<!--
  Entitlements applied when signing with a Developer ID (scripts/sign-and-notarize.sh).
  Graphist needs none for Developer ID distribution with the hardened runtime:
  Metal (including runtime shader compilation) works without extra entitlements.

  For the Mac App Store you must add the sandbox:
      <key>com.apple.security.app-sandbox</key><true/>
  plus any capabilities you use (e.g. com.apple.security.files.user-selected.read-only).
-->
